2026-10-28T17:31:05.6155287Z {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T6tGbDdV1rRdptnQHBkGSK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"number\": 18,\n3\t  \"url\": \"https://github.com/wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent/issues/18\",\n4\t  \"repo\": \"wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent\",\n5\t  \"title\": \"[Enhancement]: Support environment_role_permission_boundary in aws_datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration\",\n6\t  \"body\": \"### Description\\n\\naws_datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration does not expose the environment role permission boundary. The DataZone PutEnvironmentBlueprintConfiguration API accepts environmentRolePermissionBoundary, and the equivalent CloudFormation-backed resource awscc_datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration exposes it as environment_role_permission_boundary, but there is no corresponding argument in the aws provider.\\n\\nThe resource currently accepts only domain_id, environment_blueprint_id, enabled_regions, global_parameters, manage_access_role_arn, provisioning_role_arn and regional_parameters.\\n\\n### Affected Resource(s) or Data Source(s)\\n\\naws_datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration\\n\\n\\n### Potential Terraform Configuration\\n\\nresource \\\"aws_datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration\\\" \\\"tooling\\\" {\\n  domain_id                = aws_datazone_domain.example.id\\n  environment_blueprint_id = data.aws_datazone_environment_blueprint.tooling.id\\n  enabled_regions          = [data.aws_region.current.name]\\n\\n  provisioning_role_arn  = aws_iam_role.provisioning.arn\\n  manage_access_role_arn = aws_iam_role.manage_access.arn\\n\\n  # Requested addition\\n  environment_role_permission_boundary = aws_iam_policy.environment_boundary.arn\\n\\n  regional_parameters = {\\n    (data.aws_region.current.name) = {\\n      S3Location = \\\"s3://${aws_s3_bucket.example.id}\\\"\\n      VpcId      = aws_vpc.example.id\\n      Subnets    = join(\\\",\\\", aws_subnet.example[*].id)\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n\\n### References\\n\\nAPI \\u2014 PutEnvironmentBlueprintConfiguration, environmentRolePermissionBoundary https://docs.aws.amazon.com/datazone/latest/APIReference/API_PutEnvironmentBlueprintConfiguration.html\\nCloudFormation \\u2014 AWS::DataZone::EnvironmentBlueprintConfiguration, EnvironmentRolePermissionBoundary https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSCloudFormation/latest/UserGuide/aws-resource-datazone-environmentblueprintconfiguration.html\\nPrior art \\u2014 awscc_datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration exposes environment_role_permission_boundary https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/awscc/latest/docs/resources/datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration\\nCurrent aws provider resource documentation, showing the argument is absent [https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/aws/latest/docs/resources/datazone_environment_bluepr](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/aws/latest/docs/resources/datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration)\\n\\n### Would you like to implement the enhancement?\\n\\nNo\\n\",\n7\t  \"author\": \"zzzinn\",\n8\t  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n9\t  \"labels\": [\n10\t    \"enhancement\"\n11\t  ],\n12\t  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T17:08:40Z\",\n13\t  \"as_of\": \"2026-09-22T09:49:29Z\"\n14\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"12a54d7e-a01a-4494-ab28-021241259e76","uuid":"560a0868-1cdf-49e7-bc32-7e977bd4b492","timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:31:05.607Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/gh-aw/agent/issue.json","content":"{\n  \"number\": 18,\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent/issues/18\",\n  \"repo\": \"wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent\",\n  \"title\": \"[Enhancement]: Support environment_role_permission_boundary in aws_datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration\",\n  \"body\": \"### Description\\n\\naws_datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration does not expose the environment role permission boundary. The DataZone PutEnvironmentBlueprintConfiguration API accepts environmentRolePermissionBoundary, and the equivalent CloudFormation-backed resource awscc_datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration exposes it as environment_role_permission_boundary, but there is no corresponding argument in the aws provider.\\n\\nThe resource currently accepts only domain_id, environment_blueprint_id, enabled_regions, global_parameters, manage_access_role_arn, provisioning_role_arn and regional_parameters.\\n\\n### Affected Resource(s) or Data Source(s)\\n\\naws_datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration\\n\\n\\n### Potential Terraform Configuration\\n\\nresource \\\"aws_datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration\\\" \\\"tooling\\\" {\\n  domain_id                = aws_datazone_domain.example.id\\n  environment_blueprint_id = data.aws_datazone_environment_blueprint.tooling.id\\n  enabled_regions          = [data.aws_region.current.name]\\n\\n  provisioning_role_arn  = aws_iam_role.provisioning.arn\\n  manage_access_role_arn = aws_iam_role.manage_access.arn\\n\\n  # Requested addition\\n  environment_role_permission_boundary = aws_iam_policy.environment_boundary.arn\\n\\n  regional_parameters = {\\n    (data.aws_region.current.name) = {\\n      S3Location = \\\"s3://${aws_s3_bucket.example.id}\\\"\\n      VpcId      = aws_vpc.example.id\\n      Subnets    = join(\\\",\\\", aws_subnet.example[*].id)\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n\\n### References\\n\\nAPI \\u2014 PutEnvironmentBlueprintConfiguration, environmentRolePermissionBoundary https://docs.aws.amazon.com/datazone/latest/APIReference/API_PutEnvironmentBlueprintConfiguration.html\\nCloudFormation \\u2014 AWS::DataZone::EnvironmentBlueprintConfiguration, EnvironmentRolePermissionBoundary https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSCloudFormation/latest/UserGuide/aws-resource-datazone-environmentblueprintconfiguration.html\\nPrior art \\u2014 awscc_datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration exposes environment_role_permission_boundary https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/awscc/latest/docs/resources/datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration\\nCurrent aws provider resource documentation, showing the argument is absent [https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/aws/latest/docs/resources/datazone_environment_bluepr](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/aws/latest/docs/resources/datazone_environment_blueprint_configuration)\\n\\n### Would you like to implement the enhancement?\\n\\nNo\\n\",\n  \"author\": \"zzzinn\",\n  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n  \"labels\": [\n    \"enhancement\"\n  ],\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T17:08:40Z\",\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-09-22T09:49:29Z\"\n}","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01T6tGbDdV1rRdptnQHBkGSK","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
